-- The same unresolvable IMPORT as `unresolved-referenced.l4`, with nothing in
-- this module reading anything from it.
--
-- This is the half that was silent (smucclaw/l4-ide#971). The module typechecks
-- -- an unresolvable IMPORT does not stop it -- so the only thing that can fail
-- this fixture is the IMPORT diagnostic being believed on its own. `l4 check`
-- has always believed it and exited 1; `jl4-test` did not, because its verdict
-- was the entry module's typecheck alone, and it scored this shape a PASS. See
-- `isStructuralError` in checkFile, jl4/tests/Main.hs.
--
-- So: if this file ever goes green while its golden still shows the IMPORT
-- error, the harness has stopped looking at published diagnostics again.

IMPORT `zz-no-such-module-971`

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`double` amount MEANS amount TIMES 2
